WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.250
Which has a backup off switch: your
toaster, or the most powerful AI?

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.850
The toaster. Its US safety standard
requires a second off switch.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.150
The most powerful AI models? US federal
rules are voluntary.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:18.750
California's AI "kill switch"? Still a
study, due 16 November.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.500
The toaster's off switch has a backup. The
AI's is a sticky note.
